@*@model ESL.Models.MAccount.FiscalYearInfo*@

@*@{

    var title = "Ledger Transfer";
}*@

<div class="row">

    <div class="col-sm-12">
        <form class="form-horizontal form-bordered" autocomplete="off">
            <section class="panel">
                <header class="panel-heading">
                    <h2 class="panel-title">Fiscal Year Closing</h2>

                </header>
                <div class="panel-body form-group col-sm-12" style="border:0px">
                    <div class="col-sm-8">
                        <h5>Here you see the current working fiscal year</h5>
                        <h5>Current Fiscal Year : </h5>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-sm-8">
                        <p>In Order to close current fiscal year and start new transections for the next working fiscal year should execute following two steps.</p>
                    </div> 
                    <div class="col-sm-9">
                            <h5 class="col-sm-3"># 1st Step : </h5>
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary col-sm-6 input-sm">Create New Fiscal Year</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <p>In 1st step new fiscal year be created and you can start data entry for new fiscal Year. But all ledger balace will remain zero.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group col-sm-9">
                        <div class=" col-sm-3">
                            <h5># Final Step : </h5>
                        </div>
                            
                        
                        <div class="col-sm-6" style="float:left;">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary input-sm">Final Balance Transfer</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-sm-6">
                        <p>In final step balance will be transfered from previous fiscal year to current fiscal year.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>




            </section>
            

        </form>
    </div>
  
</div>




